    "abstract": "Parts list for the flap drive unit and its torque limiter, listing the higher rated drive solenoid and the earlier limiter valve as alternates against the torque limiter rerating modification.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the detail parts of the flap drive unit and the torque limiter installation, for one side of the aircraft.",
      "figure_note": "Item 10 and item 10A are alternates: item 10 is the higher rated drive solenoid used with the rerated limiter and item 10A is the earlier limiter valve. The higher rated solenoid is the only spare now delivered, so an aircraft may carry it without the loadable software part; the two must not be assumed to move together. The figure covers one side and both sides use the same parts list."
    },
